[513.298061, "o", "\u001b[0m, in \u001b[35m_memoized_func\u001b[0m\r\n    val = f(params)\r\n  File \u001b[35m\"/usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/scipy/optimize/_minpack_py.py\"\u001b[0m, line \u001b[35m540\u001b[0m, in \u001b[35mfunc_wrapped\u001b[0m\r\n    return \u001b[31mfunc\u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m(xdata, *params)\u001b[0m - ydata\r\n           \u001b[31m~~~~\u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;35mTypeError\u001b[0m: \u001b[35mmodel() takes 2 positional arguments but 13 were given\u001b[0m\r\n"]
